{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-07T06:33:12Z","input_tokens":4163,"cache_read_tokens":53415,"output_tokens":1719,"thinking":"Planning component structure based on the PDF requirements; the application will be organized into components under a `components` directory. `App.jsx` will manage the overall flow, switching between logged-in and logged-out views. Data and event handling between parent and child components will be managed via props. Initial components to create include `LoginForm.jsx`. This component will handle user ID and password as React state, also an error message state.\n\n\nComponent structures are being outlined for login, header, event list, note list, note detail, and note form. Each component's responsibilities, props, and states are defined to ensure data flow and UI rendering are handled correctly. Error handling for empty states, loading states, and API failures are considered for a robust user experience.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"import React, { useState } from 'react';\\nimport { login } from '../api/authApi';\\n\\nexport default function LoginForm({ onLoginSuccess }) {\\n  const [username, setUsername] = useState('');\\n  const [password, setPassword] = useState('');\\n  const [errorMessage, setErrorMessage] = useState('');\\n  const [isLoading, setIsLoading] = useState(false);\\n\\n  const handleSubmit = async (e) => {\\n    e.preventDefault();\\n    setErrorMessage('');\\n\\n    // 빈 입력 검사 (클라이언트 및 서버 양쪽 대응)\\n    if (!username.trim() || !password.trim()) {\\n      setErrorMessage('아이디와 비밀번호를 모두 입력해 주세요.');\\n      return;\\n    }\\n\\n    setIsLoading(true);\\n    try {\\n      const response = await login(username.trim(), password);\\n      if (response && response.user) {\\n        onLoginSuccess(response.user);\\n      }\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      if (err.status === 400) {\\n        setErrorMessage(err.message || '입력값이 올바르지 않습니다.');\\n      } else if (err.status === 401) {\\n        setErrorMessage(err.message || '아이디 또는 비밀번호가 올바르지 않습니다.');\\n      } else {\\n        setErrorMessage(err.message || '로그인 중 오류가 발생했습니다.');\\n      }\\n    } finally {\\n      setIsLoading(false);\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className=\\\"login-container\\\">\\n      <div className=\\\"login-card\\\">\\n        <div className=\\\"login-header\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"login-badge\\\">mini-watch</div>\\n          <h2>감시 대시보드 로그인</h2>\\n          <p className=\\\"login-subtext\\\">운영자 계정으로 로그인하여 일반 서비스의 요청 기록과 관찰 메모를 관리하세요.</p>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        {errorMessage && (\\n          <div className=\\\"alert alert-error\\\" role=\\\"alert\\\">\\n            <span className=\\\"alert-icon\\\">⚠️</span>\\n            <span>{errorMessage}</span>\\n          </div>\\n        )}\\n\\n        <form onSubmit={handleSubmit} className=\\\"login-form\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"f\n<truncated 1334 bytes>","Description":"\"Create src/components/LoginForm.jsx\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\work\\\\mini-watch-day03-start\\\\monitor\\\\frontend\\\\src\\\\components\\\\LoginForm.jsx\"","toolAction":"\"Creating LoginForm.jsx\"","toolSummary":"\"Create LoginForm component\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
